        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Mulligan, James Foley\n- Roles: Film director, television director\n- Works: To Kill a Mockingbird, Summer of '42, The Other, Same Time, Next Year, The Man in the Moon\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Mulligan was born on August 23, 1925, and died on December 20, 2008.\n- Robert Mulligan was an American film and television director.\n- Robert Mulligan was best known for directing humanistic American dramas.\n- Robert Mulligan directed \"To Kill a Mockingbird\" in 1962.\n- Robert Mulligan directed \"Summer of '42\" in 1971.\n- Robert Mulligan directed \"The Other\" in 1972.\n- Robert Mulligan directed \"Same Time, Next Year\" in 1978.\n- Robert Mulligan directed \"The Man in the Moon\" in 1991.\n- James Foley was born on December 28, 1953.\n- James Foley is an American film director.",
